170	Evaluate the teaching outcomes from 0.0 to 1.0 (masteryGain, retention, engagement, transfer, confusion). Also provide an overall 'score' (0.0=failure to 1.0=mastery) computed as: score = masteryGain*${weights.masteryGain.toFixed(2)} + retention*${weights.retention.toFixed(2)} + engagement*${weights.engagement.toFixed(2)} + transfer*${weights.transfer.toFixed(2)} - confusion*${weights.confusion.toFixed(2)}
171	Provide 1 to 3 string sentences explaining the outcome in the 'explanation' array. 
172	Respond ONLY as a JSON matching:
173	{
